  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"A suite of 12 lithographs by Tom Phillips based on Brahms Opus 45. The images were derived from postcards collected by the artist in Germany and have inset texts, which are treated fragments of the novel 'A human document' by W.H. Mallock, and titles quoting the textual material of the Requiem itself."</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
